===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ar}} {{term|رمضان||tr=ramaɖáːn|sc=Arab}}, from {{term|ارتمض||to be consumed by grief and sorrow|tr=irtámaɖa|sc=Arab}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɹæməˈdɑːn/|/ˈɹæmədæn/}}

===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun|pl=Ramadans}}

# {{Islam}} The [[holy]] ninth [[month]] of the [[Islamic]] [[lunar]] [[calendar]], during which [[Muslim]]s [[fast]] between the break of [[dawn]] until [[sunset]]; they also refrain from drinking liquids, [[smoking]] and having [[sexual]] [[relation]]s.

